Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 02:35:37 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] cohere: CohereForCausalLM / Cohere2ForCausalLM (Aya Expanse,
 Tiny Aya)

Parallel attention+MLP block reading one bias-free LayerNorm (copied to
ln1 and ln2), interleaved RoPE, logit_scale folded into W_U. Cohere2 adds
sliding-window layers from config.layer_types and NoPE on full-attention
layers via proportional_rotary_factor=0 (from 0004). Config conversion reads
the HF config, so local checkpoint dirs of either architecture load too.
